{"reviews":[{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-0","r":5.0,"t":"Perk up drab skin tone","x":"I absolutely love these highlighter! I'm in my early 60's and my skin tends to look drab but with these I highlight my cheeks and around my eyes and it just perks my skin up and gives me a nice glow, I mean who doesn't want a little brighter look ,am I right ladies?!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-1","r":5.0,"t":"Beautifully pigmented","x":"Beautiful sturdy packaging. Amazingly pigmented, well worth the $8 bucks!","h":9,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-2","r":5.0,"t":"Wasn\u2019t broken!","x":"It wasn\u2019t broken and it smelled like freshly baked cinnamon rolls","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-3","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful!!!","x":"I received my package today, and I swatched the colors on my arm to see how pigmented they are. I was AMAZED. Just by opening it up, I love it!!! Such beautiful colors, you won\u2019t regret it!!! I am definitely going to be reordering when I run out! I love the packaging, the cover is soooo cute!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-4","r":5.0,"t":"I loved it","x":"I\u2019m absolutely amazed by the way it makes your skin glow in a natural way. The shades are perfect because even if you use the lighter one it blends perfectly","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-5","r":5.0,"t":"I loved it","x":"I\u2019m absolutely amazed by the way it makes your skin glow in a natural way. The shades are perfect because even if you use the lighter one it blends perfectly","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-6","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE","x":"Such an amazing set! I get compliments all the time and use as eye shadow sometimes to give my look a nice POP!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-7","r":1.0,"t":"Arrived broken","x":"Not happy at how my purchase arrived at all.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-8","r":4.0,"t":"I love the candy-like packaging. So cute!","x":"I love the packinging.  It's so cute how it looks like a box of candy. I bought it for my grandmother for Christmas. She's been wanting some highlighter. I hope she likes it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-9","r":4.0,"t":"Works better for tanner skin.","x":"I got these highlighters for my younger sister so she could practice her makeup. The packaging is cute, the actual highlighters are mediocre. There\u2019s only 1 highlighter that actually performs like a highlighter with really nice pigmentation, the others are okay but not as pigmented as the one, but they do layer well.  They just  don\u2019t glow as much as the other one. Overall, I would probably try a different one, but it wasn\u2019t a bad deal.  Also, this is going to work better for you if you have mor","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-10","r":4.0,"t":"Nice highlight","x":"Cute package, nice shine. But I received my product in bad condition. Just for that I didn't give them the 5 stars.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-11","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy!","x":"Best highlighter I have purchased in a while! I love the top left color... I get compliments all the time!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-12","r":5.0,"t":"Shine bright","x":"This highlight was pretty good for being at a cheaper price","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-13","r":1.0,"t":"Defective products","x":"Will never but again,  I bought this to go along with my daughters Christmas present which is a vanity, the entire thing was a crumbled mess. There is no way to return it so I had to trash it! Im glad it wasnt expensive but I will never buy this brand again or advise anyone else to!!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-14","r":3.0,"t":"Meh \ud83d\ude15","x":"Highlighter looks very pretty in it's packaging. Not a great product. I don't find myself reaching for this highlighter. If you scratch off the top layer it's better. I don't want to scratch up the product for it to work. Lack luster. Just a meh product for me.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-15","r":5.0,"t":"Great pigment, great price.","x":"After looking and looking this one popped out with the best price, reviews, and packaging appeal. Bought it for my God daughter for her quincea\u00f1era and she LOVED IT. great pigment. Don\u2019t need a lot and the price is on point.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-16","r":5.0,"t":"Baked pops","x":"I don\u2019t know why people are complaining about it coming cracked or whatever when it literally comes bubble wrapped (that\u2019s a you problem sis). Highlighters look amazing and it looks good!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-17","r":5.0,"t":"Awsome!","x":"Real worthy, quality against price. High quality makeup, I use it not only as highlighter, but as eyeshadow, line under eyebrow, mid lips, combining the four different tones. Love it!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-18","r":3.0,"t":"Easily Broken","x":"All of the colors were cracked in half and one of them was like completely destroyed luckily it was a super dark color sooo I dont really use that one but it looks really pretty on.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-19","r":5.0,"t":"ABSOLUTELY LOVED IT","x":"THIS HIGHLIGHT IS AMAZINGGG... it last forever on your face. Very pigmented and the box it comes in is soooo cute!! I loved it. I WOULD DEFINITELY RECOMMEND IT.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-20","r":5.0,"t":"Buy it girl, it\u2019s worth it..","x":"I absolutely love this product! I\u2019ve always just did gold  highlight but I\u2019m like obsessed with these colors. You have to get it it\u2019s amazing.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-21","r":5.0,"t":"Must BUY!!!","x":"So beautiful and fun packaging! Careful how you open the box , the highlights are loose but they work so well! Pigment is strong and light !","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-22","r":5.0,"t":"Must buy!","x":"This is so beautiful! I love the way the highlights look. They also smell like candy! They give you that glow that you want.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-23","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome!","x":"Great bronzer and highlighter. Only thing I don\u2019t care for is the huge box packaging. Makes it hard to put into a makeup bag","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B074R5ZVKN-24","r":5.0,"t":"love this product!","x":"first of all, the packaging is so cute! these highlighters are subtle but very buildable and pigmented! very good purchase","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the pigmentation and glow, saying the highlighters are beautifully pigmented and give skin a natural, bright glow.","cites":[1,2,4,5,6,12]},{"text":"Many reviewers love the cute, candy-like packaging.","cites":[2,4,9,10,11]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product arrived broken, crumbled, or in bad condition.","cites":[8,11,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers find the product mediocre or lackluster, with inconsistent pigmentation across shades.","cites":[10,15]},{"text":"Reviewers consider it good value for the low price.","cites":[2,13]}]},"qa":[]}